<title>BRAZIL: Brazil to release Feb monetary base data 1400 GMT.</title>
<headline>Brazil to release Feb monetary base data 1400 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bank will release monetary base figures for February at 1100 local/1400 GMT, a bank spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>She said she could not confirm a report on Invest News that the bank would also be releasing public sector debt figures for the month of January.</p>
<p>((--John Miller, Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248-5414))</p>
